# Closed-class words that never stand as a counted noun right after an hour:
# pronouns, adverbs and verb particles ("a las 8 te llamo").  Each word's class
# is quoted from its Wiktionary entry (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/<word>); the
# fetched pages are kept with the audit.  Markup is removed from the quotes.
# me: Pronoun. "inflection of eu (acc//dat, reflexive)"
# te: Pronoun. "inflection of ti (acc, reflexive)"
# o: Pronoun. "inflection of el (acc)"
# lle: Pronoun. "inflection of el,ela (dat): (to) him/her/it"
# nos: Pronoun. "alternative form of os (them)"
# vos: Pronoun. "inflection of vós (acc//dat, reflexive)"
# lles: Pronoun. "inflection of eles (dat)"
# se: Pronoun. "inflection of si (acc//dat)"
me
te
o
lle
nos
vos
lles
se
